msgstr "ຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນກະວຽກ ແລະ ໃບສັ່ງເຊົ່າ"

#. module: sale_renting_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_renting_planning/models/planning_slot.py:0
msgid ""
"The shift should not be in conflict to be able to correctly add it to an "
"existing rental order."
msgstr ""
"ກະວຽກບໍ່ຄວນມີການທັບຊ້ອນກັນ ຈຶ່ງຈະສາມາດເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໃບສັ່ງເຊົ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. module: sale_renting_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_renting_planning/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"This Sales Order can't be confirmed. No enough resources are available for "
"the shifts in: %(product_name)s."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍນີ້ໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີຊັບພະຍາກອນພຽງພໍສຳລັບກະວຽກໃນ: %(product_name)s."

#. module: sale_renting_planning
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/sale_renting_planning/models/sale_order_line.py:0
msgid ""
"This Sales Order can't be confirmed. No resources are available for the "
"shifts in: %(problematic_services)s."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍນີ້ໄດ້. ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີຊັບພະຍາກອນຫວ່າງສຳລັບກະວຽກໃນ: %"
"(problematic_services)s."
